<p>Call upon the legendary resilience of the Dwarven race to increase armour (<acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">+7, +11, +17, +21, +25</acronym>), armour hardiness (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+19%, +27%, +31%, +33%, +35%</acronym>), spell (<acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">+12, +15, +21, +25, +30</acronym>) and physical (<acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Constitution 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">+12, +15, +21, +25, +30</acronym>) saves for 8 turns.</p><p>The bonuses will increase with your Constitution.</p>